{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;A nightmare that begins with a click.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Attraction of Spell is a short but intense first-person horror-escape game that begins with a cinematic opening scene.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After opening a mysterious email on your computer, you suddenly find yourself in an abandoned house.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The doors are locked behind you, and the lights are out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You must navigate the darkness of the room to find the keys and the exit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But be careful\u2014unexpected jumpscares can catch you off guard at any moment in this house.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd26 Key Features</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cinematic opening sequence</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Short and intense horror experience</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple puzzles and exploration-focused gameplay</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic light, shadow, and soundscape</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Escape may be easy...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >but where will you go?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4082710?t=1760123047","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4082710?t=1760123047","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4082710/9cd24ab8ed065e5f5e82a92e79040945c3f58562/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760123047","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4082710/9cd24ab8ed065e5f5e82a92e79040945c3f58562/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760123047","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Captions available","id":13},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;A nightmare that begins with a click.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The 